.TH MTST 1.SH NAMEmtst \- exercise the C maths library's rounding.SH SYNOPSIS\fBmtst\fR.SH DESCRIPTION\fBmtst\fRruns a set of numbers through\fBceil\fR,\fR\fBfloor\fRand\fBround\fRand prints each result as floating point and as integer side by side:.nf    a: 0.100000   ceil(a): 1.000000   floor(a): 0.000000   round(a): 0.fi.PPOne of the small programs Paul Farquhar's spline package was checkedwith..SH NOTESNeeds Microware's\fBcio\fR.\fR